00:08:26.600 --> 00:08:27.980
Ensuite, il y a l'approche hybride Azure

00:08:27.980 --> 00:08:29.360
où Azure a dessert de courtier

00:08:29.360 --> 00:08:30.300
entre l'identité cloud

00:08:30.300 --> 00:08:31.760
